Z||000000||d825077||07-02-2000||11:13 AM||||Is it hard to change the drive belt on a 1988 4 cylinder Fiero?  How do I lossen the belt?  Once the belt is off is it hard to put the new one on and get it tight?  tia||||reg||4
Z||000001||theogre||07-02-2000||11:29 AM||||it's held by a spring loaded idler pulley. put a 15 mm socket on the idler pulley bolt and rotate the arm toward the battery.<P>read this thread. <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/004506.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/004506.html</A>  ||||reg||1
